message: "If you use this software, data or results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Every Accounting Rule Is an Option: Reinforcement-Learning Traders Learn to Exploit Loss Forgiveness, and a Sign-Paired Reward Prevents It"
authors:
  - alias: gepapak
version: "4.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gepapak/accounting-options-rl"
license:
